[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3356194031","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111112#issuecomment-3356194031","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111112","id":3356194031,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7IC3Tv","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-01T13:02:00Z","updated_at":"2025-10-01T13:02:00Z","body":"This is some kind of dependency resolution bug in `GDScriptCache` and/or `ResourceLoader`. Even though there don't seem to be cyclic dependencies, it apparently results in type mismatches in the cache.\n\n```mermaid\ngraph LR\nmain.gd ==> Thing\nmain.gd ==> Intermediate\nThing ==> Modifier\nThing ==> Attribute\nIntermediate ==> spicy.tres\nIntermediate ==> Thing\nIntermediate --> Attribute\nModifier ==> spicy.tres\nspicy.tres ==> Attribute\n```\n\nDespite all our efforts, `preload()` still has bugs. Personally, I avoid it in my projects, with the exception of preloading `GDScript`s and simple resources like textures and sounds, which definitely don't have their own dependencies. For loading scenes and resources, I use `load()`, caching the resource in a static, non-static, or local variable if necessary.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3356194031/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3368850248","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111112#issuecomment-3368850248","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111112","id":3368850248,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7IzJNI","user":{"login":"SpaceAttorney","id":73031083,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMDMxMDgz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73031083?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpaceAttorney","html_url":"https://github.com/SpaceAttorney","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpaceAttorney/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpaceAttorney/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpaceAttorney/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpaceAttorney/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpaceAttorney/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpaceAttorney/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpaceAttorney/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpaceAttorney/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpaceAttorney/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-05T08:12:01Z","updated_at":"2025-10-05T08:12:01Z","body":"For the record, my use case was that I wanted to try using consts as shorthand to refer to specific files on disk, in a way somewhat analogous to `Vector2.ZERO` or `Color.WHITE`, and consts require the use of `preload()`. For the moment, I've found a workaround using static vars that load the files on `get()`, which functions approximately like a const as far as I can tell.\n\nAnyway, having messed with both the MRP and my own project more, I don't think the dependency relationship is as straightforward as my initial post claimed, so the reproduction steps I listed probably won't be very helpful after all.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3368850248/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5078214962","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111112#issuecomment-5078214962","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111112","id":5078214962,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABLq9pMg","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-25T10:51:29Z","updated_at":"2026-07-25T10:51:29Z","body":"Can reproduce in v4.5.1.stable.official [f62fdbde1]\nCan't reproduce in v4.7.1.stable.flathub [a13da4feb]","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5078214962/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]